OL,3,GNEWSA'A sad outcome' - Administrators
OL,4,Aappointed to Glens of Antrim Potatoes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdministrators have been appointed to
OL,7,Fthe agri-food business, Glens of Antrim
OL,8,FPotatoes.
OL,10,FThe company operates from sites in
OL,11,FCushendall and Ballymena and employs 95
OL,12,Fstaff, most of whom have lost their
OL,13,Fjobs.
OL,15,FStuart Irwin, Ian Leonard and Robin
OL,16,FCoughlin from Interpath were appointed
OL,17,Fjoint administrators on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
