OL,3,GNEWSA'A sad outcome' - Administrators
OL,4,Aappointed to Glens of Antrim Potatoes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement said the company had now
OL,7,Fstopped trading and "with deep regret"
OL,8,Fall its employees, aside from a
OL,9,Fskeleton staff supporting the
OL,10,Fadministrators, had been made
OL,11,Fredundant.
